{"id":"600d3de34015fa31","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-path.md","title":"Path","display":"df-path — Path","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-path","aliases":["58-df-path","Path"],"display":"df-path — Path","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-path"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-path</span><span>Path</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-path — Path"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topological space)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma: [0,1] \\to X\">\\(\\gamma: [0,1] \\to X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0,x_1\\in X\">\\(x_0,x_1\\in X\\)</span> (map and endpoints)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{[0,1]}\">\\(\\tau_{[0,1]}\\)</span> is the subspace topology inherited from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (continuous-map predicate from dependency)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Path}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Path}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (path predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\\)</span>，取所引内部实子空间拓扑定义的唯一值。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}path} \\vdash \\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x_0,x_1,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow x_0,x_1\\in X\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\gamma,[0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]},X,\\tau)\\land\\gamma(0)=x_0\\land\\gamma(1)=x_1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}path} \\vdash \\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x_0,x_1,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow x_0,x_1\\in X\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\gamma,[0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]},X,\\tau)\\land\\gamma(0)=x_0\\land\\gamma(1)=x_1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Path: a continuous map from the unit interval with declared endpoints; the domain and codomain topologies are carried by the canonical continuity predicate.</li>\n<li>Homotopy: path homotopy keeps endpoints fixed; fundamental group structure</li>\n<li>Lifting: covering spaces lift paths uniquely to given starting point</li>\n<li>Geodesic: shortest path in metric space; may not exist; minimizes length</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma: [0,1] \\to X","display":false},{"tex":"x_0,x_1\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{[0,1]}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Path}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}path} \\vdash \\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x_0,x_1,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow x_0,x_1\\in X\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\gamma,[0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]},X,\\tau)\\land\\gamma(0)=x_0\\land\\gamma(1)=x_1","display":true}],"bytes":1452,"backlinks":[{"id":"c100dce18000d9e7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Path}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (path predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-path.md]])"},{"id":"eb320629ddc49775","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)$ (typed path predicate, see [[58-df-path]])"},{"id":"7bc072a211934ba8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-948","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-path.md|58-df-path]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["3b5b3d48ff1ff369","815e63e5071e7b58","3cd1834de4f2efb2"]}